<div class="hero container">
  <h1>Freight coordination for serious operators</h1>
  <p>Transport WEB helps shippers and carriers manage load discovery, bidding, assignment, and delivery progress from one professional workspace.</p>
  <% if (!user) { %>
    <a href="/auth/register" class="btn btn-primary">Create Account</a>
    <a href="/auth/login" class="btn btn-secondary">Sign In</a>
  <% } else { %>
    <a href="/loads/current" class="btn btn-primary">Browse Loads</a>
    <a href="/loads/upload" class="btn btn-secondary">Post Load</a>
  <% } %>
</div>

<div class="features container">
  <div class="feature glass-card">
    <h3>Structured Load Posting</h3>
    <p>Create detailed transport requests with route, timing, and shipment information that carriers can assess quickly.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="feature glass-card">
    <h3>Controlled Bidding</h3>
    <p>Compare offers through a time-based bidding workflow that keeps load decisions clear and easy to track.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="feature glass-card">
    <h3>Operational Visibility</h3>
    <p>Review profiles, complaints, and delivery progress so teams can make stronger dispatch and carrier decisions.</p>
  </div>
</div>
